Part of the original question was about not being able to cross
the water on the Medusa level.  Since there are a few other
levels where you'll need to be able to cross water that's a
major goal at this point.

Check *all* armor for levitation.  All blessed or uncursed try it
on and keep the best.  Maybe even stack all the +0 in one
stack, +2 in another and so on.  For all cursed armor whose
type isn't IDed, gather up one of each and get them identified.
If you find leviation boots then you're good to proceed.  So you
have two parallel goals - Trade your damaged armor for better
undamaged and/or fooproof your current stuff, plus find levitation.

Also check the types of all unknown rings for levitation.  Check
all books for cone of cold, all wands for cold.  In future games
zap a cold wand once, learn its type, and hoard the rest for
water levels.  Worse comes to worse, dig, bypass, and come
back with leviation or freezing.

You have levels filled with friendlies.  If you can't find your
needed items elsewhere, start mowing them down for their
stuff.  If you kill co-laigned unicorns understand the luck price.



